questions.a:
- The purpose of the Notice is to:

  1. Inform AVR Voters that, as of their DMV Transaction Date, they are registered to vote in Delaware as an unaffiliated ("No Party") voter;
  2. Provide AVR Voters the opportunity to choose a party affiliation if they wish;
  3. Provide AVR Voters the opportunity to review their eligibility to register and cancel their registration if they are ineligible or do not want to be registered to vote at this time; and
  4. Advise AVR Voters of Delaware's Address Confidentiality Programs, outlined in 15 Del. C. § 1303 (https://delcode.delaware.gov/title15/c013/index.html) and 11 Del. C. § 9613. (https://delcode.delaware.gov/title11/c096/sc02/index.html)
